N:HOW READ (2026-11-11): Every bar totals four quarter units. Bars 1-2: C quarter, D quarter, E half; G half, E half. Bars 3-4: E-D quarters, C half; G whole. Bars 5-6: G-A-G-E quarters; D half, E half. Bars 7-8: E-G quarters, D half; C whole. Pitch set C-D-E-G-A, range a sixth, largest leap a fourth, AB form 4+4.
N:UNCERTAIN: Breath, dynamic span, success of the constrained variation and originality against common pentatonic school songs require classroom and second-reader review.
